      "filePath": "frappe/core/doctype/report/report.py",
      "summary": "Core Report DocType controller handling four report types: Report Builder, Query Report, Script Report, and Custom Report. Manages report lifecycle (validate, export, trash), permission checks, query execution with SQL safety checks, script execution via safe_exec, standard report building with group-by/order-by, and prepared report auto-enablement via threading.",
